MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-74: Billing — top-up and auto-reload
TAGS=billing,stripe,correctness
MODE=dynamo
BODY=On a SaaS installation with a Stripe test card, confirm a manual top-up raises the balance and creates no subscription, that auto-reload is off by default, that enabling it self-heals a drained balance without blocking a review, that several concurrent reviews below the threshold produce exactly one charge (the autoReloadInFlight guard), and that a declined card surfaces the failure and blocks rather than running unpaid. No fixture PR.
